scope: "Application framework specification for complex Python programs that participate on the ComposeIO bus — dual-bus architecture, namespace export/import crossover, config-driven setup, cross-platform equivalence"
audience: "Python developers building bus-native CLI apps, service hub maintainers, firmware developers implementing the same pattern on MCUs"
boundary: "Application-level patterns only; bus protocol in 01-composeio-bus-protocol.smd; config schema in 02-composeio-config-schema.smd; module roles in 03-composeio-module-roles.smd"
not-this: "Not the bus protocol itself; not module firmware; not ComposeUX-specific UI behavior (ComposeUX uses this framework via composition — see ux_composer specs)"
